learnings/
/.code-health
/.ik-jscpd
# NOTE: this must exclude the CONTENTS (/docs/*), not the directory (/docs).
# git never descends into an excluded directory, so a `!` negation inside one
# is silently dead — which is why /docs/plans stayed untracked.
/docs/*
# …but keep the implementation plans: they are the design record for the
# refactors (plans 70+), referenced by commit messages and by the agents that
# execute them. Without this the entire rationale for a change lives on one machine.
!/docs/plans/

